<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Portfolio of A Arthi - Computer Science and Engineering student.">
    <title>A Arthi | CSE Student Portfolio</title>
    <style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

:root {
    --bg: #0b1020;
    --surface: #11182d;
    --surface-light: #17213b;
    --text: #f5f7ff;
    --muted: #aab4cc;
    --accent: #67e8f9;
    --accent-2: #8b5cf6;
    --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    --max-width: 1120px;
}

* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
}

a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
}

.container {
    width: min(90%, var(--max-width));
    margin: 0 auto;
}

.header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(11, 16, 32, 0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.navbar {
    min-height: 72px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
}

.logo {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
}

.logo span,
.hero h1 span {
    color: var(--accent);
}

.nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
}

.nav-links a {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: 0.3s ease;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
}

.hero {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.12), transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 80%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12), transparent 25%);
}

.hero-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.6fr;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 90px 0;
}

.eyebrow,
.section-label {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.7rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 18px 0 25px;
}

.hero-description {
    max-width: 700px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
}

.hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn {
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: 0.3s ease;
}

.primary-btn {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #071016;
}

.primary-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    opacity: 0.9;
}

.secondary-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
}

.social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 28px;
}

.social-links a {
    color: var(--muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
}

.social-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
}

.hero-card {
    padding: 40px 30px;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--surface-light), var(--surface));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
}

.initials {
    width: 130px;
    height: 130px;
    margin: 0 auto 25px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-2), var(--accent));
    color: #08101b;
}

.hero-card p {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
}

.hero-card h3 {
    margin: 7px 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
}

.hero-card span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.section {
    padding: 100px 0;
}

.section-alt {
    background: #0e1528;
}

.section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.section-heading h2 {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-top: 8px;
}

.about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: start;
}

.about-text {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.info-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.info-item {
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.info-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
}

.info-item span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
}

.info-item strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
}

.skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
}

.skill-card {
    padding: 32px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: 0.3s ease;
}

.skill-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.5);
}

.skill-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.10);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
}

.skill-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
}

.skill-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
}

.timeline {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 850px;
    padding-left: 28px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.timeline-item {
    position: relative;
}

.timeline-dot {
    position: absolute;
    left: -34px;
    top: 7px;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.08);
}

.timeline-content {
    padding: 5px 0 20px;
}

.timeline-year {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.timeline-content h3 {
    margin: 6px 0;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
}

.timeline-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
}

.project-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
    padding: 38px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 18px;
    transition: 0.3s ease;
}

.project-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.5);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.project-number {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
}

.project-type {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 700;
}

.project-content h3 {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin: 5px 0 10px;
}

.project-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 700px;
}

.project-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.project-tags span {
    padding: 6px 11px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
}

.interests {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.interest {
    padding: 18px 25px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.interest span {
    margin-left: 7px;
}

.contact-section {
    padding: 110px 0;
    text-align: center;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.10), transparent 35%),
        #0e1528;
}

.contact-content > p:not(.section-label) {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 15px auto 25px;
    color: var(--muted);
}

.contact-section h2 {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
}

.email-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.contact-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 25px;
}

.contact-links a {
    color: var(--muted);
}

.contact-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
}

footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 25px 0;
}

.footer-content {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
}

.footer-content a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
    .nav-links {
        display: none;
    }

    .hero-content,
    .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
        min-height: auto;
    }

    .hero-content {
        padding: 75px 0;
    }

    .hero-card {
        max-width: 380px;
    }

    .skills-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .project-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
    }

    .project-number {
        font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .section {
        padding: 75px 0;
    }

    .footer-content {
        flex-direction: column;
    }
}

</style>
</head>
<body>

    <header class="header">
        <nav class="navbar container">
            <a href="#home" class="logo">A<span>.</span>Arthi</a>

            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
                <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
                <a href="#education">Education</a>
                <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="home" class="hero">
            <div class="container hero-content">
                <div class="hero-text">
                    <p class="eyebrow">COMPUTER SCIENCE & ENGINEERING STUDENT</p>
                    <h1>Hello, I'm <span>A Arthi</span></h1>
                    <p class="hero-description">
                        A 2nd year Computer Science and Engineering student at
                        Government College of Technology, Coimbatore, passionate
                        about programming and building my skills to become a good software engineer.
                    </p>

                    <div class="hero-buttons">
                        <a href="#projects" class="btn primary-btn">View My Projects</a>
                        <a href="#contact" class="btn secondary-btn">Contact Me</a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="https://github.com/arthiarun2810-wq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/arthi-a-6444453a4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-card">
                    <div class="initials">AA</div>
                    <p>2nd Year</p>
                    <h3>B.E. Computer Science & Engineering</h3>
                    <span>GCT • Coimbatore</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="about" class="section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="section-label">ABOUT ME</p>
                    <h2>A little about me</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="about-grid">
                    <div>
                        <p class="about-text">
                            I am A Arthi, a 2nd year Computer Science and Engineering
                            student at Government College of Technology, Coimbatore.
                            I am interested in programming and continuously working
                            on improving my technical and problem-solving skills.
                        </p>
                        <p class="about-text">
                            My goal is to become a good software engineer and use
                            technology to create useful and meaningful solutions.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="info-card">
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <span>Degree</span>
                            <strong>B.E. Computer Science and Engineering</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <span>Year</span>
                            <strong>2nd Year</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <span>College</span>
                            <strong>Government College of Technology, Coimbatore</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <span>Goal</span>
                            <strong>Software Engineer</strong>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="skills" class="section section-alt">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="section-label">SKILLS</p>
                    <h2>Technologies I work with</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="skills-grid">
                    <div class="skill-card">
                        <div class="skill-icon">C</div>
                        <h3>C Programming</h3>
                        <p>Building a strong foundation in programming and problem solving using C.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="skill-card">
                        <div class="skill-icon">J</div>
                        <h3>Java</h3>
                        <p>Learning object-oriented programming and developing Java applications.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="skill-card">
                        <div class="skill-icon">&lt;/&gt;</div>
                        <h3>Web Development</h3>
                        <p>Learning HTML and CSS to create clean and responsive web pages.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="education" class="section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="section-label">EDUCATION</p>
                    <h2>My academic journey</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline">
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                        <div class="timeline-content">
                            <span class="timeline-year">CURRENT</span>
                            <h3>B.E. Computer Science and Engineering</h3>
                            <p>Government College of Technology, Coimbatore</p>
                            <p>2nd Year</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects" class="section section-alt">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="section-label">PROJECTS</p>
                    <h2>What I've worked on</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-number">01</div>
                    <div class="project-content">
                        <span class="project-type">Academic Project</span>
                        <h3>Earth Alarm Stimulator</h3>
                        <p>
                            An academic project focused on developing an alarm-based
                            concept related to earthquake awareness and alerting.
                        </p>
                        <div class="project-tags">
                            <span>Engineering Project</span>
                            <span>Problem Solving</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="section-label">INTERESTS</p>
                    <h2>Beyond coding</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="interests">
                    <div class="interest">📚 <span>Reading Books</span></div>
                    <div class="interest">🎵 <span>Listening to Music</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="contact-section">
            <div class="container contact-content">
                <p class="section-label">GET IN TOUCH</p>
                <h2>Let's connect.</h2>
                <p>
                    I'm always interested in learning, building projects,
                    and connecting with people in technology.
                </p>

                <a href="mailto:arthiarun2810@gmail.com" class="email-link">
                    arthiarun2810@gmail.com
                </a>

                <div class="contact-links">
                    <a href="https://github.com/arthiarun2810-wq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/arthi-a-6444453a4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container footer-content">
            <p>© 2026 A Arthi. Built with HTML & CSS.</p>
            <a href="#home">Back to top ↑</a>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
